    description: "Apple iPhone Duo\n\nUnfold endless possibilities with the Apple iPhone Duo, designed to combine tablet-level productivity with everyday smartphone portability. Its expansive foldable display gives you a vibrant canvas for effortless multitasking, immersive viewing, and creative editing on the move. Built with an advanced titanium frame, it feels incredibly solid in hand while staying pleasantly slim. Dual high-res cameras deliver pro-grade photography with stunning clarity, and a massive battery powers you through demanding days. It’s the ultimate statement piece for power users needing peak performance everywhere.\n\nFoldable LTPO OLED Display\n\nEnjoy ultra-smooth scrolling and vibrant colors across an expansive dual-screen layout that transforms daily viewing, dynamic multitasking, and mobile entertainment into a truly immersive high-end visual experience.\n\nCeramic Shield 2 Protection\n\nInnovative glass construction with anti-reflective coating and Nano Texture finish keeps your display durable while maintaining a smooth tactile feel for everyday touch interactions. \n\nGrade 5 Titanium Frame\n\nEngineered with premium Grade 5 titanium for superior structural strength, this robust yet lightweight frame gives you exceptional impact resistance alongside a comfortable feel in your hand.\n\nReliable All-Day Battery\n\nDelivers dependable power throughout demanding workdays with PD3.2 fast wired charging and 25W MagSafe/Qi2 wireless charging support.\n\nAdvanced Spatial Video & Audio\n\nCapture realistic 3D spatial videos accompanied by rich stereo audio recording, allowing you to re-experience your favorite personal memories with breathtaking depth, clarity, and life-like realism.\n\nApple iPhone Duo Key Highlights\n\n• Large foldable screen provides an expansive space for smooth multitasking.\n\n• Slim folded design fits comfortably into pockets for easy carrying.\n\n• Dynamic refresh rate ensures fluid touch interactions during daily usage.\n\n• Under-display selfie camera keeps the view clear without annoying cutouts.\n\n• Strong Grade 5 titanium frame protects device during accidental everyday drops.\n\n• Fast wireless charging support keeps power routines quick and simple.\n\n• Satellite emergency features provide reliable peace of mind everywhere.\n\nView more from the iPhone category.\n\nCheck Similar Product Price\n\n• iPhone 18 Pro Max\n\n• iPhone 18 Pro\n\nFAQ\n\nWhat is the expected price of the Apple iPhone Duo in Bangladesh?\n\nThe estimated price of the Apple iPhone Duo in Bangladesh is expected to start around ৳3,40,000 to ৳4,00,000 for the base 256GB variant, with higher storage options…",
