    description: "JBL Boombox 4 Wireless Speaker\n\nThe JBL Boombox 4 is the kind of speaker that refuses to be ignored. With upgraded JBL Pro Sound, it brings chest-thumping bass and crystal-clear highs through its twin 5 inch woofers, dual tweeters, and three passive radiators. AI Sound Boost reads your tracks in real time, pushing volume and clarity to new heights without distortion, so you can crank it without hesitation. Want to shape the mood? Switch between deep rumbling lows or a punchier Bass Boost for sharper kicks. \n\nReady to rock the block, beach, or backyard, the new refreshed IP68 design makes it lighter yet larger and more durable, so you can carry it everywhere and vibe along. Surprisingly massive 99Wh battery keeps the music alive for up to 34 hours with Playtime Boost, while Bluetooth 5.4 ensures smooth, stable streaming. The Boombox 4 is power, presence, and party in one.\n\nJBL Boombox 4 Wireless Speaker Features\n\n• Twin five inch woofers and dual tweeters craft a sound that feels spacious and alive.\n\n• AI Sound Boost adapts each track and keeps clarity intact even at thundering volume.\n\n• Bass Boost mode sharpens kicks while deep lows rumble with chest pleasing gravity.\n\n• Three passive radiators add warmth and resonance, enriching layers in the tracks.\n\n• Massive 99Wh battery sustains up to thirty four hours with intelligent playtime boost.\n\n• IP6 rated design stands against elements while remaining lighter for easier carrying.\n\n• Bluetooth 5.4 delivers stable streaming so music flows without annoying signal stutters.\n\n• Refreshingly bold build radiates presence, turning backyards, beaches, and blocks into shared soundscapes.\n\nBuy from Mr Tom Gadgets: Your Trusted Tech Partner\n\nLooking to get your hands on the JBL Boombox 4 Wireless Speaker? Mr Tom Gadgets has you covered. As the leading destination for genuine tech gear in the nation, we offer the widest range of accessories, smartphones, tablets and more. \n\nFor hassle-free online shopping or convenient in-store experience, Mr Tom Gadgets is known for top-notch customer support and competitive pricing. We deliver your favorite tech with speed and care. So if you’re hunting for the best deal on the JBL Boombox 4 Wireless Speaker, this is the exact place to be.\n\nExplore more from Bluetooth Speakers and stay updated on the latest arrivals at Mr Tom Gadgets.\n\nCheck Similar Product Price\n\n• AWEI Y333 Bluetooth Speaker\n\n• Harman Kardon Soundsticks 4 Bluetooth Speaker\n\n• Bose SoundLink Revolve+ II Bluetooth Speaker\n\n• Sony SRS-XB100 Wireless Bluetooth Speaker",
